{"game":"Kirby: Planet Robobot","source":"custom","apworld":"kirby_robobot.apworld","world_version":"0.1.0","groups":[{"name":"Game Options","collapsed":false,"options":[{"key":"progression_balancing","name":"Progression Balancing","kind":"named_range","doc":"A system that can move progression earlier, to try and prevent the player from getting stuck and bored early.\n\nA lower setting means more getting stuck. A higher setting means less getting stuck.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>A system that can move progression earlier, to try and prevent the player from getting stuck and bored early.</p>\n<p>A lower setting means more getting stuck. A higher setting means less getting stuck.</p>\n","min":0,"max":99,"default":50,"special":{"disabled":0,"normal":50,"extreme":99},"doc_fr":"Un système qui peut déplacer la progression plus tôt, pour essayer et empêcher le joueur de se coincer et s'ennuyer tôt.\n\nUn réglage plus bas signifie qu'il reste coincé. Un réglage plus élevé signifie moins se coincer.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Un système qui peut déplacer la progression plus tôt, pour essayer et empêcher le joueur de se coincer et s'ennuyer tôt.</p>\n<p>Un réglage plus bas signifie qu'il reste coincé. Un réglage plus élevé signifie moins se coincer.</p>\n"},{"key":"accessibility","name":"Accessibility","kind":"choice","doc":"Set rules for reachability of your items/locations.\n\n**Full:** ensure everything can be reached and acquired.\n\n**Minimal:** ensure what is needed to reach your goal can be acquired.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Set rules for reachability of your items/locations.</p>\n<p><strong>Full:</strong> ensure everything can be reached and acquired.</p>\n<p><strong>Minimal:</strong> ensure what is needed to reach your goal can be acquired.</p>\n","choices":[{"value":"full","label":"Full","id":0},{"value":"minimal","label":"Minimal","id":2}],"aliases":{"items":"full","locations":"full","none":"minimal"},"default":"full","doc_fr":"Définir les règles d'accessibilité de vos objets/emplacements.\n\n**Full:** s'assurer que tout peut être atteint et acquis.\n\n**Minimal:** s'assurer que ce qui est nécessaire pour atteindre votre objectif peut être acquis.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Définir les règles d'accessibilité de vos objets/emplacements.</p>\n<p><strong>Full:</strong> s'assurer que tout peut être atteint et acquis.</p>\n<p><strong>Minimal:</strong> s'assurer que ce qui est nécessaire pour atteindre votre objectif peut être acquis.</p>\n"},{"key":"goal","name":"Goal","kind":"choice","doc":"The victory condition for your game.\n\nstory_star_dream: Defeat Star Dream at the end of Story Mode.\nstory_boss_count: Defeat a set number of Story Mode bosses (see story_boss_count).","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"choices":[{"value":"story_star_dream","label":"Story Star Dream","id":0},{"value":"story_boss_count","label":"Story Boss Count","id":1}],"aliases":{},"default":"story_star_dream"},{"key":"story_boss_count","name":"Story Boss Count","kind":"range","doc":"If Goal is story_boss_count, how many Story Mode bosses must be defeated.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"min":1,"max":6,"default":6},{"key":"sticker_checks","name":"Stickersanity","kind":"toggle","doc":"Stickersanity: add every normal Sticker as its own location (one per\nsticker in the album).\n\nWARNING: this adds a large number of locations and, because normal stickers\nare collected passively as you play, they end up available across most of\nthe game at once. That can make for difficult or strange logic, since the\ngenerator has many always-open locations to work with and the usual sense of\nprogression through the stickers does not apply. Turn this on only if you\nwant that. Rare Stickers are a separate, smaller set (see\nrare_sticker_checks) and are on by default.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"default":"false"},{"key":"rare_sticker_checks","name":"Rare Sticker Location Checks","kind":"toggle","doc":"Include the 35 in-stage Rare Sticker pickups as locations.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"default":"true"},{"key":"open_all_stages","name":"Open all stages","kind":"toggle","doc":"Open every normal stage in an Area as soon as you can reach the Area, so\nyou can play them in any order. Boss doors still need their Code Cubes, and\nEX stages keep their own unlock rules.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"default":"true"},{"key":"ability_gating","name":"Ability Gating","kind":"toggle","doc":"Only let Kirby keep copy abilities you've received.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"default":"false"},{"key":"armor_gating","name":"Armor Mode Gating","kind":"toggle","doc":"Also gate copy abilities while in the Robobot Armor.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"default":"false","doc_fr":"Aussi les capacités de copie de portail pendant que dans l'armure Robobot."},{"key":"death_link","name":"Death Link","kind":"toggle","doc":"When you die, everyone dies. When anyone dies, you die.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"default":"false"},{"key":"kirby_color","name":"Kirby Color","kind":"choice","doc":"Recolor Kirby's body. Cosmetic only chosen once at generation and baked\ninto the patched ROM. 'pink' leaves the game stock. Textures are from the\ncommunity KPR retexture pack (native Robobot format).","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"choices":[{"value":"pink","label":"Pink","id":0},{"value":"red","label":"Red","id":1},{"value":"yellow","label":"Yellow","id":2},{"value":"green","label":"Green","id":3},{"value":"chalk","label":"Chalk","id":4},{"value":"shadow","label":"Shadow","id":5},{"value":"snow","label":"Snow","id":6},{"value":"carbon","label":"Carbon","id":7},{"value":"ocean","label":"Ocean","id":8},{"value":"sapphire","label":"Sapphire","id":9},{"value":"grape","label":"Grape","id":10},{"value":"emerald","label":"Emerald","id":11},{"value":"orange","label":"Orange","id":12},{"value":"chocolate","label":"Chocolate","id":13},{"value":"cherry","label":"Cherry","id":14},{"value":"citrus","label":"Citrus","id":15},{"value":